  "instructions": [
    "Wash and slice cucumber thinly.",
    "Prepare low-sodium harissa yogurt sauce by mixing plain yogurt, crushed garlic, lemon juice, and a pinch of harissa paste.",
    "Lay a whole wheat pita flat on a plate.",
    "Spread a thin layer of the harissa yogurt sauce over the pita.",
    "Place sliced cucumber across the pita.",
    "Arrange 80 g of sashimi-cut tuna over the cucumber.",
    "Sprinkle sliced fresh mint and a few lemon zest curls for aroma.",
    "Fold the pita in half and roll tightly to form a wrap.",
    "Warm the wrap in a skillet for 30 seconds on each side to toast lightly.",
    "Slice the wrap diagonally and serve immediately."
